-- floor scripts. Re-running is fine (it replaces its own, tagged World3Prop).
-- Clusters hugging the walls, the course's middle clear: palms, crates, cannons, treasure,
-- docks, rowboats, skull rocks and a shipwreck in Pirate Cove; giant flowers, hedges, fences,
-- toadstools, topiary, gnomes and watering cans in the Garden; lollipops, candy canes, ice
